{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'Just leaving you a note.' she moves out of the way so he can read.","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:28:38.169000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865313932104171550","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Ah. I can't really 'say hi' in the morning for a while, you know.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:30:12.214000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865314326558801970","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'...' she curses in Deep Speech.","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:30:32.485000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865314411580358685","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'I apologise. It's been... An interesting day.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:30:48.411000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865314478379368479","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"You're still kicking, and able to make jokes, so sounds like not a bad kind of interesting overall, I suppose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:31:36.446000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865314679851974686","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"she shrugs. 'Jokes are a coping mechanism, I suppose. Even if I can't fully enjoy them now...'","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:32:23.343000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865314876553560115","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'...how tired are you? If I talk through it with you now, it might help me rest more peacefully... Of course, if you need to sleep, don't let me stop you.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:33:38.777000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865315192946032680","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"I don't specifically *need* to sleep, but I really have nothing to do anyway.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:34:30.654000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865315410534203392","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'...you don't need to sleep either? Wait, if you were to not sleep, what would be your meditation schedule?'","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:35:41.923000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865315709458317322","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"I do need to sleep. Just not at the moment. I'll probably just lie in required silence for a while.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:36:46.202000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865315979063721984","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'...would companionship help? I can send Kukudh.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:37:56.570000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865316274208636948","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'Or myself, but I don't think anyone could sleep with this watching over them.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:38:30.538000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865316416680099880","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"I wouldn't be saying anything anyway. Not much to do with companionship like that, I suppose.","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:38:53.539000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865316513153417225","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'Alright. Just, if you want to borrow Kukudh...' `I can serenade you to sleep!` they caw raspily. it is clear they cannot do this.","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:40:27.077000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865316905481011271","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'...anyway. Basically.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:41:54.104000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865317270497656874","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'I went to... oh no. I forgot about that.' she stops suddenly.","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:42:25.771000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865317403319992361","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"sighs, and continues. 'Well, multiple things, then.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:42:39.316000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865317460130660372","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'Tort ended up dead again. Eaten by a goose, apparently. We took him to the Mender, but he couldn't do much - something about Tort wouldn't fit with the tenets.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:43:24.941000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865317651496697926","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'He also said, though... something about me selling myself to a mass of horrors. I... I don't remember anything like this. You would think I would...'","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:44:20.317000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865317883759427585","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"she shivers slightly.","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:44:26.666000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-15T19:44:29.718000Z","id":"865317910389325835","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Well, if not much else you can remember either. And I suppose I can imagine, I wouldn't be surprised if after thirty times even Mender was to lose patience.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:45:15.609000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865318115671932979","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Did you come by Bo, perhaps?\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:45:52.587000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865318270768381972","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'I haven't seen Bo since the sewers earlier... did something happen?'","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:46:16.141000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865318369560231946","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"He recognized the body I brought to the park as his friend, and with Mender's help brought it to some people called 'Ravens', in Kingsbridge. I don't know how he is now, I wanted to assist him, but even shifted I couldn't keep up with a bear through the whole island.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:47:43.889000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865318737602805770","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'Ravens? That sounds like people I was told about...'","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:48:22.034000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865318897594531860","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'So Bo was shifted into a bear, and you into something slower?'","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:48:47.726000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865319005354459166","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Mender made him a bear so he could run faster and carry the body by himself.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:49:24.929000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865319161396068402","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"she nods. 'I see... what about you?'","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:50:08.777000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865319345307516979","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"I can just turn into something faster for like a minute.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:50:48.398000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865319511490297856","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Than myself normally. Not than a bear.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:51:12.712000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865319613470736405","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Kukudh (somehow, for a bird) looks disappointed.","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:51:23.629000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865319659259691008","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Sabrine though, in the same tone she uses for the bugs, says 'That's fascinating. You can just... change yourself at will?'","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:51:57.957000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865319803241365505","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Yeah, I just need a nap later. I guess it never came up before. I haven't had much use for what I can do best in a while, I suppose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:53:29.877000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865320188781789195","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'You and the bugs... Just fascinating.' she gets slightly lost in thought; Kukudh baps her with a wing. 'Ah, sorry. Where was I?'","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:54:35.666000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865320464720199720","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"The docks.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:55:10.595000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865320611222650910","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
