{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'She put his remains and some of that strange fog covering the area in... a body even more of a disfigured, chimaeric mess than mine. Somehow, it worked.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:57:07.298000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865321100711297024","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"You're really overestimating your condition.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:57:59.775000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865321320815525888","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'...you think so?'","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:58:23.936000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865321422153973771","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"You're human-shaped and just got a long tongue. Really not that much.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:59:56.553000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865321810618875944","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'...I don't even know what I have instead of blood. I can just see it through my skin.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T20:00:30.258000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865321951988023396","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"But it works, I suppose? And you're still accomplishing a lot with what you got.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T20:01:42.456000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865322254806941696","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
