{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Indeed you do.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T20:04:24.917000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865322936219336714","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'...I guess you're right. Thanks.' she smiles briefly, but then continues, 'Anyway. Tort seems to be alright... somehow? So I decided to talk to the, ah, architect for a bit. Try and get some questions answered.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T20:05:42.234000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865323260509552650","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'I ended up with more questions than I started with.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T20:05:58.225000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865323327580012574","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"But it steered you in some direction, didn't it?\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T20:06:29.048000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-15T20:06:42.240000Z","id":"865323456861831178","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'I'm honestly not sure. Like...' she switches to telepathy, ||I don't know if I want to know who I was any more. Heore said I could just start a new life, but at the same time, I want to at least know how I died...||","created_at":"2021-07-15T20:07:27.776000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865323703185309716","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"||I don't know how much of this body is even me.||","created_at":"2021-07-15T20:07:39.380000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865323751856013312","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Mine was turned into a puddle before Mender granted me a new one. Is it me? As a spirit I was just a swarm. That's who I am, that's what persists. That I look the same is just a convenient bonus. And going by my example, maybe sometimes it might be better to forget how you had died.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T20:09:51.317000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865324305238720554","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'...that is a very good point. But then... what would I be as a spirit?'","created_at":"2021-07-15T20:10:51.978000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865324559669657610","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Who knows? Yourself, most likely.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T20:11:25.864000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865324701798236220","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'But which me? Sabrine, or just plain Sab?'","created_at":"2021-07-15T20:11:45.676000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865324784896311306","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Aren't those both part of one whole?\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T20:12:32.460000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865324981121187913","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'...I don't know. I created Sabrine as a shield...'","created_at":"2021-07-15T20:13:44.926000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865325285066407996","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'Is that shield also me, or just an expression?'","created_at":"2021-07-15T20:14:13.255000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865325403887239169","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"No idea. Nonetheless you're still doing admirably well, and so is everyone else we've met and talked to. Even Tort, with the endless determination. I don't think you have that much to worry about about that question.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T20:15:48.595000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865325803771658261","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"she thinks for a moment, then nods. '...thank you. I think that did help.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T20:17:08.116000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865326137307168768","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'I'm still going to look into the option of finding out... but it's my choice. I don't have to go through with it.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T20:17:45.089000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865326292383825972","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
